## lunr language packs not vendored

Calva docs search is English-only: `mkdocs.yml` does not set
`plugins.search.lang` (MkDocs defaults to English). Material loads
`javascripts/lunr/` helpers (lunr-languages stemmers, `tinyseg.js`,
`wordcut.js`, and non-English `lunr.*.min.js` packs) only when non-English
search languages are configured. Those files are **not** included in
`docs-builder/vendor/material-9.5.16/`. The builder fails with a clear error if
`plugins.search.lang` is set to anything other than English. English search uses
lunr 2.3.9 embedded in `workers/search.*.min.js` only.

